<title>USA: United Technologies names CFO.</title>
<headline>United Technologies names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Technologies Corp said on Thursday that it has named Charles Noski executive vice president and chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>Noski succeeds Stephen Page, who was elected president and chief executive officer of the Otis Elevator subsidiary of United Technologies, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Noski was previously chief financial officer of Hughes Electronics Corp, United Technologies said.</p>
